SystemRequirements: None required for installation. Optional runtime tools:
    OpenSlide command-line tools; libvips command-line tools; Bio-Formats
    command-line tools; external StarDist or Cellpose commands; optional ZEISS
    libCZI for native CZI builds; optional local web services for interactive
    workflows.
Config/testthat/edition: 3
